license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.10.4
date-released: "2026-09-12"
keywords:
  - ai-security
  - agent-security
  - model-context-protocol
  - tool-validation
  - least-privilege
  - llm-safety
abstract: >-
  An in-process, deny-by-default contract layer and type-checker for AI agent
  tool calls. It intercepts calls into MCP servers and agent frameworks,
  validates arguments under Pydantic V2 strict mode with no coercion, strips
  parameters the model invented, applies policy (RBAC, rate limits, cost
  budgets, capability gating), and sandboxes dangerous execution. Ships
  per-CVE guards mapped to named advisories and adapters for twelve agent
  frameworks. The installed core depends only on Pydantic.
